      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALISON'S MISSION (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (17.97) in a Grade 6 at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Can make amends. HERE COMES MARG (4) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at Mandurah over 300m behind Defender (17.87) in a Grade 5/6. Was in the money prior to that. The form out of last race has been strong. Should play a prominent role. PUMP FAKE (5) overcame a check to place in a Grade 6 at this track over 297m latest, finishing a 5.5 lengths third (17.84). Has box 5 this time where he has three wins. Should be in this for a long way. GRANDAD KEVIN (1) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
